# Intent: Find lineage edges that carry data with no classification label, indicating
#         CUI flowing through the pipeline without the required marking. Unclassified
#         edges break the CUI traceability chain mandated for IL4/IL5 ATO compliance.
# Expected violation shape: rows where classification == null;
#   each row is an untagged lineage edge that must receive a classification before ATO.

foreach e in data.lineage.edges
  where e.classification == null
  select e.id, e.source_node_id, e.target_node_id, e.column_name, e.classification
